# 301 .html URLs to the extensionless canonicals (P3).
# force (!) so the real .html files do not shadow the redirect.
# Clean URLs still serve 200: Netlify maps /privacy -> privacy.html internally,
# with no hop back to .html, so this does not loop.
# Query strings are forwarded (destinations have no '?'). Browsers keep #r=
# fragments across the 301; the server never sees the fragment.
/index.html           /                   301!
/skins.html           /skins              301!
/stableford.html      /stableford         301!
/daily-handicap.html  /daily-handicap     301!
/privacy.html         /privacy            301!
/feedback.html        /feedback           301!
/feedback-thanks.html /feedback-thanks    301!
